			<div class="content" id="post-content-4840976">
									

<p>How about a series of roads that aren't connected in reality but here form a long road, but it is different for each person that enters it. Playing with the &quot;highway to hell&quot; idea, it could lead to different places depending on a person's life choices. Then you could describe a mission that the members of the group slowly start to get scattered and find themselves in different places despite the fact they were walking together and never strayed from one another.<br />
It's a raw idea but maybe it can inspire you!</p>

