<p>Hello!<br />
So, I feel like this idea is still too raw. Connected points in space are nothing new and the pathologic horror aspect is a bit convoluted as is. I don't see any reasons why electronic equipment shouldn't work on the rooms, in fact, I think the video of the girl could be a nice element in a &quot;found footage&quot; way. Have her exploring and explaining her experience and feelings as she gets lost/absorbed/transported/idk by the cubes. This first person perpective could be what makes it more unique.</p>

