<p>Hi there!<br />
So, this doesn't sound particularly new or interesting. It really reminds me of the movie Monster House and feels a lot like a Courage the Cowardly Dog episode. The core of this idea is basic, as it is your best shot is to build more on the old lady's story, maybe tie her to some relevant event or person as a way to bring more interest.<br />
