<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> 250 year old clockwork Mannequin SCP with anomalous healing properties that fixates on its patients and defends fatally wounded patients until their death/recovery, or its own death</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> SCP is picked up through word of mouth rumour and is reported to the coucil who send an mtf team after it. Dramatic mtf encounter where villagers attempt to stop the task force from attacking it and try to persuade them it just wants to help. Once it's taken back to a foundation site, it's placed under low level containment during testing of properties as it didn't resit initial mtf containment. After a task force operation goes wrong, the SCP breaks containment and goes to protect the mtf operator until the doctors approach calmly and it let's them help. After this its moved to special containment and special procedures are out in place</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Dramatic scenes between the SCP, mtf team, and locals who've looked after the SCP during inital containment, and then between the security team and scp once on site during a containment breach</p>
